# This repo had no .gitignore at all, which meant `git add -A` swept in
# anything sitting in the working tree — including generated images and,
# worse, any API key dropped in here. Keys belong outside the repo
# (~/.foreverprint-fal-key); these rules are the second line of defence.

# throwaway working files: generated image variants, test pages
scratch/

# credentials — never, under any name
.env
.env.*
*.key
*-key
*.pem
fal-key*
service-key*

.DS_Store
node_modules/

# Documents written for a supplier or a partner. The repository is PUBLIC, and
# this one sets out the 20% trade discount, our cost base and our whole pricing
# method in one place. It is meant for PrintedEasy, not for everyone.
foreverprint-pricing-method.pdf
